Parakeet custom vocabulary rescoring, from Hex's transcribe.cpp fork

anomalyco/transcribe.cpp at 7045d1c0fe7cee37747b2792977421d435e75fca (the
revision Hex ships), limited to the Parakeet vocabulary changes: no bindings,
ggml or Vulkan changes. MIT, like transcribe.cpp. Upstream request:
https://github.com/handy-computer/transcribe.cpp/issues/126

After the greedy decode, a span of the transcript that sounds like a term is
rescored against the term over the same encoder frames, and replaced when the
term scores at least as well plus a boost per piece. Fills
transcribe_run_params::vocabulary for Parakeet RNN-T and TDT heads.

